{"id":12536,"date":"2025-04-07T07:14:36","date_gmt":"2025-04-07T07:14:36","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=12536"},"modified":"2025-04-07T07:15:55","modified_gmt":"2025-04-07T07:15:55","slug":"pozvanka-na-workshop-infracervena-nanoskopie-mekkych-materialu","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/pozvanka-na-workshop-infracervena-nanoskopie-mekkych-materialu\/","title":{"rendered":"Pozv\u00e1nka na workshop Infra\u010derven\u00e1 nanoskopie m\u011bkk\u00fdch materi\u00e1l\u016f"},"content":{"rendered":"<p class=\"\" data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"635\">V\u00e1\u017een\u00ed u\u017eivatel\u00e9! Srde\u010dn\u011b v\u00e1s zveme na jedine\u010dn\u00fd analytick\u00fd workshop zam\u011b\u0159en\u00fd na nanoskopii na KTH \u2013 Kr\u00e1lovsk\u00e9m technick\u00e9m institutu ve Stockholmu, ve spolupr\u00e1ci s <a href=\"https:\/\/www.attocube.com\/en\/business-sectors\/nanoscale-analytics\"><strong>Attocube Systems<\/strong><\/a> (<a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/ir-neascopes\/\">Neaspec<\/a>). Tento workshop je jedine\u010dnou p\u0159\u00edle\u017eitost\u00ed potkat \u0161pi\u010dkov\u00e9 v\u011bdce, kte\u0159\u00ed st\u00e1li u zrodu infra\u010derven\u00e9 nanoskopie a dnes ji vyu\u017e\u00edvaj\u00ed v cel\u00e9 \u0161k\u00e1le v\u00fdzkumn\u00fdch oblast\u00ed.<\/p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"879\">Nav\u00edc budete m\u00edt mo\u017enost <strong data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"714\">bezplatn\u00e9ho m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed va\u0161ich vlastn\u00edch vzork\u016f<\/strong>. M\u016f\u017eete se t\u011bmito seancemi inspirovat v nov\u00fdch projektech, \u017e\u00e1dostech o granty, publikac\u00edch a nav\u00e1zat nov\u00e1 p\u0159\u00e1telstv\u00ed a spolupr\u00e1ce.<\/p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"291\"><strong data-start=\"191\" data-end=\"231\">KTH, Stockholm, 20. \u2013 21. kv\u011btna 2025<\/strong><br data-start=\"231\" data-end=\"234\" \/><strong data-start=\"237\" data-end=\"291\">M\u011b\u0159en\u00ed va\u0161ich vzork\u016f: 22. \u2013 23. kv\u011btna 2025<\/strong><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"918\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"918\">Hlavn\u00ed body programu:<\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"1349\">\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"1025\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"1025\"><strong data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"943\">\u00davodn\u00ed p\u0159edn\u00e1\u0161ky:<\/strong> Inspirativn\u00ed prezentace odborn\u00edk\u016f na AFM, IR a nanoskopii v infra\u010derven\u00e9m oboru<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1106\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1106\"><strong data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1044\">\u017div\u00e1 uk\u00e1zka:<\/strong> NanoIR demonstrace na biomateri\u00e1lech a polymern\u00edch vzorc\u00edch<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1212\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1212\"><strong data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1129\">Posterov\u00e1 sekce:<\/strong> Prostor pro diskuzi o aplikaci infra\u010derven\u00e9 nanoskopie na va\u0161e v\u00fdzkumn\u00e9 projekty<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1349\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1349\"><strong data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1246\">Interaktivn\u00ed m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed vzork\u016f:<\/strong> P\u0159ineste si vlastn\u00ed vzorek a z\u00fa\u010dastn\u011bte se <strong data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1319\">praktick\u00e9ho m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed zdarma<\/strong> (nutn\u00e1 p\u0159edchoz\u00ed rezervace)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1380\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1380\">Detaily akce:<\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1455\"><strong data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1399\">M\u00edsto kon\u00e1n\u00ed:<\/strong><br data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1402\" \/>KTH Royal Institute of Technology, Stockholm, \u0160v\u00e9dsko<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"1462\" data-end=\"1481\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Registra\u010dn\u00ed poplatek:<\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1652\">\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1532\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1532\"><strong data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1524\">Zv\u00fdhodn\u011bn\u00e1 registrace do 30. dubna:<\/strong> 150 \u20ac<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1652\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1652\"><strong data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1574\">Standardn\u00ed registrace po 30. dubnu:<\/strong> 200 \u20ac<br data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1583\" \/><em data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1652\">(v cen\u011b je ob\u010derstven\u00ed, ob\u011bdy po oba dny workshopu a spole\u010dn\u00e1 ve\u010de\u0159e)<\/em><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_9779\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-9779\" style=\"width: 600px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-9779\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/12\/22fa6be1-300x257.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"513\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/12\/22fa6be1-300x257.jpg 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/12\/22fa6be1-1024x876.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/12\/22fa6be1-768x657.jpg 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/12\/22fa6be1.jpg 1150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-9779\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/ir-neascopefs\/\"><strong>IR-neascope+fs<\/strong><\/a>, jeden z modul\u00e1rn\u00edch SNOM mikroskop\u016f spole\u010dnosti <strong>Attocube<\/strong> (d\u0159\u00edve Neaspec)<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n","protected":fa